    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "• menu\nCover Design\nby Lillian Sader.\nOne of America's leading\nyoung arlists, Miss Sader\ncombines a deft color touch\nwith a sensitive flair\nfor intricate design.\nFor the Orient\nshe has created\na unique tableau of\nthese familiar attractions\nTypical Chinese Gateway\nDaibutsu-giant image of Buddha\nFujiyama\nThe Torii-formal Japanese Gateway\nGeisha Girl in Japanese Garden\nA Chinese Pagoda, Pedicab\nPhilippine Rice Field\nSampan and Siamese Temples\nComplete set of menus\nsuitable for framing may be\nobtained upon request\nPAN AMERICAN WORLD AIRWAYS GR\nPRINTED IN US A"
